Error [jet.FieldWriteWithoutMarker]: Cannot edit through this read-only `SharedGuard` view
  --> tests/ui/ownership/shared_read_guard_value_is_not_writable.jet:7:17
    |
  7 |     guard.value.value += 1
    |                 ^^^^^
 Why: A public guard type outside its acquisition site preserves read access unless a helper explicitly receives it with write access
 Fix: Keep the edit at the acquisition site, or pass the guard to a helper that declares it with write access, such as `guard: &SharedGuard<T>`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0205

Error [jet.FieldWriteWithoutMarker]: Cannot edit `value` — `guard` has read access only
  --> tests/ui/ownership/shared_read_guard_value_is_not_writable.jet:7:17
    |
  7 |     guard.value.value += 1
    |                 ^^^^^
 Why: Editing a field requires write access to the owning place
 Fix: Declare it with `guard := ...` to give it write access
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0205
